# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the sanitizers job in tests.yml.
#
# Mesa's software Vulkan driver (lavapipe) leaks a little when Dawn asks it
# for its devices, and from its own worker threads. The driver is unloaded by
# the time the report prints, so its frames show as <unknown module>: what is
# left to match is the Dawn frame that called into it, and for the threads
# their start. Our code starts threads only on Windows, so on Linux every
# other thread is Dawn's or the driver's.
leak:dawn::native::vulkan::GatherPhysicalDevices
leak:asan_thread_start
